WEBVTT

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:08.057
Such sad, sad faces.
这么悲伤的脸

00:00:08.231 --> 00:00:11.103
But now is a time
only for joy.
但现在是开心的时刻

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:15.238
You are going to be part
of something beautiful.
你们即将见证伟大与美丽

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:17.370
[growls]

00:00:17.544 --> 00:00:19.807
Once we reach the harbor,
我们一旦到了港口，当着世人…

00:00:19.982 --> 00:00:21.548
in front of all the world,
我们一旦到了港口，当着世人…

00:00:21.722 --> 00:00:25.813
you and your precious
kung fu will die.
你和你们宝贵的功夫都必死无疑

00:00:25.988 --> 00:00:27.903
[laughs]
你和你们宝贵的功夫都必死无疑

00:00:28.077 --> 00:00:32.951
Then China will know
to bow before me.
然后全中国的人都要向我鞠躬

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:34.083
Set sail!
启程！

00:00:34.257 --> 00:00:35.475
- Aargh!
- [clang]
启程！

00:00:36.694 --> 00:00:39.001
[laughter]

00:00:39.175 --> 00:00:40.828
[all gasp]

00:00:46.008 --> 00:00:47.444
What is that?

00:01:07.986 --> 00:01:11.163
Honestly, guys,
I never thought
I'd die like this.
老实说，我没想到自己会这样死

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:14.297
I always thought I'd meet
a nice girl and settle down
我一直以为能遇到心仪的女子，成家…

00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:16.168
and then she'd eat my head.
让后她吃了我的头，真惨

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.823
- So sad.
- We cannot give up hope.
我们不能放弃希望，
阿宝一定希望我们坚强

00:01:18.997 --> 00:01:20.520
Po would want us
to remain strong.
我们不能放弃希望，
阿宝一定希望我们坚强

00:01:20.694 --> 00:01:23.480
Hardcore.
Right, Tigress?
要有硬功夫…对吧，娇虎？

00:01:31.488 --> 00:01:33.142
Lord Shen,
what about the bridge?
沈大人，那么桥呢？

00:01:33.316 --> 00:01:35.361
Nothing stands in my way.
什么也不能阻拦我

00:01:36.188 --> 00:01:37.320
[Shen] Fire!
开火！

00:01:43.587 --> 00:01:44.980
[shouts of panic]

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.418
You coward!
胆小鬼！

00:01:58.036 --> 00:01:58.994
Po?
阿宝？

00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:02.867
[all] Po!
阿宝！

00:02:04.173 --> 00:02:05.391
Huh?
这辈子我要宰多少次臭熊猫？

00:02:05.565 --> 00:02:07.350
How many times
do I have to kill
这辈子我要宰多少次臭熊猫？

00:02:07.524 --> 00:02:10.048
the same stinking panda?
这辈子我要宰多少次臭熊猫？

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:21.103
Shen!
姓沈的！

00:02:21.277 --> 00:02:23.844
A panda stands
between you and your...
一只熊猫拦了你的路…

00:02:24.019 --> 00:02:25.324
[distant] ...destiny.

00:02:26.195 --> 00:02:27.152
What?
什么？

00:02:27.326 --> 00:02:28.762
Prepare yourself for a hot...
准备接受…

00:02:28.936 --> 00:02:31.287
[distant] ...
serving of justice.

00:02:31.461 --> 00:02:33.115
Your reign of terror
comes to an end.

00:02:33.289 --> 00:02:36.553
- What?
- And now, free the Five!
现在，放了五猛将！毁灭圆盘！

00:02:36.727 --> 00:02:38.729
Disc of Destruction!
现在，放了五猛将！毁灭圆盘！

00:02:44.996 --> 00:02:46.911
[Wolf Soldiers grunt]

00:02:47.477 --> 00:02:48.782
[groans]

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.176
OK.
好

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:52.743
Take aim!
瞄准！

00:03:04.102 --> 00:03:06.496
- Ready?
- Oh!
预备？

00:03:07.236 --> 00:03:08.106
[grunts]

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.065
Ohh! Aargh! Ow!

00:03:11.762 --> 00:03:13.111
[grunts]

00:03:14.373 --> 00:03:15.983
Oh, ho, ho, ho!

00:03:18.116 --> 00:03:20.858
[grunting]

00:03:21.032 --> 00:03:23.469
This way and that way.
That way and this way.
这边那边，那边这边

00:03:26.603 --> 00:03:27.865
You can't follow me.
不能跟我走

00:03:28.822 --> 00:03:29.867
Just get him!
干掉他！

00:03:30.781 --> 00:03:33.000
[chuckles nervously]

00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:35.090
Oh!

00:03:35.264 --> 00:03:36.917
- Yeah, huh. Here we go.
- Come on!
见鬼！

00:03:37.831 --> 00:03:39.181
[gasps]

00:03:40.704 --> 00:03:41.835
Ya-ha!

00:03:44.186 --> 00:03:45.578
- No, no, no, don't shoot!
- Don't shoot!
不！别开炮！

00:03:45.752 --> 00:03:47.145
No, don't shoot!
别开炮！

00:03:47.319 --> 00:03:50.105
- Don't shoot.
- Don't shoot!
别开炮！ 别开炮！

00:03:50.279 --> 00:03:51.671
I won't shoot
if you won't shoot.
你不能开炮！ 你不开我就不开！

00:03:51.845 --> 00:03:52.846
Don't shoot!
别开炮！

00:03:53.891 --> 00:03:55.327
Woo-woo! Hah!

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:57.242
Don't shoot! Crossfire!
别开炮！多重交火！

00:03:57.416 --> 00:03:58.374
Attack!
出击！

00:04:00.724 --> 00:04:02.204
Hi-yah! Yah!

00:04:04.554 --> 00:04:05.729
Catch of Freedom!
自由接斧！

00:04:05.903 --> 00:04:06.991
Monkey!
金猴！

00:04:12.431 --> 00:04:14.564
Impressive, Dragon Warrior.
What's your plan?
厉害，龙战士，有何计划？

00:04:14.738 --> 00:04:15.869
Step one: Free the Five.
第一步：解救五将！ 第二步呢？

00:04:16.043 --> 00:04:17.393
What's step two?
第一步：解救五将！ 第二步呢？

00:04:17.567 --> 00:04:19.308
Honestly, I didn't think
I'd make it this far.
老实说，我没想到能走到这一步

00:04:19.482 --> 00:04:22.311
- Po!
- Uh, stop Shen
before he gets to the harbor.
趁姓沈的还没到码头，赶快截住他

00:04:27.272 --> 00:04:28.926
Woo-hoo! Nice.
哎咿呀！甚好！

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.843
Viper, Puppet of Death!
灵蛇，死亡玩偶！

00:04:33.626 --> 00:04:34.584
Tigress!
娇虎！

00:04:38.979 --> 00:04:40.851
[Master Ox shouts]

00:04:41.025 --> 00:04:41.939
Huh!

00:04:42.113 --> 00:04:44.333
[gasps] Master Ox!
牛大师！

00:04:44.507 --> 00:04:46.509
- Cham-pah!
- [Po] And Croc!
鳄鱼大师！

00:04:46.683 --> 00:04:47.988
Vengeance is served.
复仇成功！

00:04:48.163 --> 00:04:49.555
- Why did you...?
- Your friend there
你怎么会… 你的朋友太有说服力

00:04:49.729 --> 00:04:50.904
is very persuasive.
你怎么会… 你的朋友太有说服力

00:04:54.908 --> 00:04:56.214
Hi-yah!

00:04:56.388 --> 00:04:57.824
Yoo-ha! Wah!

00:04:58.651 --> 00:04:59.783
Master Shifu!
师傅！

00:05:02.133 --> 00:05:04.440
Quickly. Use their boats
to block the way.
快！用他们的船阻截！

00:05:12.752 --> 00:05:15.102
Aah! Aah! Aah!

00:05:15.277 --> 00:05:16.191
Crane!
仙鹤！

00:05:17.235 --> 00:05:20.630
Wings of Justice!
Ka-kaaa!
正义之翅！

00:05:20.804 --> 00:05:22.414
Woo-hoo-hoo! Yeah!

00:05:23.502 --> 00:05:24.590
Yee-haw!

00:05:28.681 --> 00:05:29.639
What?
什么？

